          <button class="edit-node-preview" type="button" aria-label="Edit title and summary" title="Edit title and summary here (F2)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m14 5 5 5M4 20l5-1L20 8a2 2 0 0 0-5-5L4 14Z"/></svg></button>
